  "home.tech.lead":     { "en-US": "Every XHOPE machine starts with the motor. Our in-house digital motor, machined aerospace-grade alloy and tuned acoustics deliver extreme suction in a body that feels weightless in the hand.", "zh-CN": "每一台 XHOPE 设备都从马达开始。自研数码马达、航空级合金与声学调校，在轻盈手感中释放强劲吸力。" },

