  "home.motor.title":   { "en-US": "125,000 RPM. Nothing else comes close.", "zh-CN": "125,000 转。无出其右。" },
  "home.motor.body":    { "en-US": "Our X9 digital motor spins at 125,000 revolutions per minute — generating suction that lifts ground-in dirt from deep inside carpets and upholstery. Ceramic bearings, a machined impeller and acoustic baffling keep it quiet enough to talk over.", "zh-CN": "X9 数码马达每分钟 125,000 转——产生足以掀起地毯与软装深处积尘的吸力。陶瓷轴承、机加工叶轮与声学隔层，让它在运转时仍可轻声交谈。" },
